'''Pangkajene''', officially the '''Republic of Pangkajene''' (Marosan: ᨑᨛᨄᨘᨅᨘᨒᨗᨀᨗ ᨄᨊᨛᨁᨛᨀᨛᨍᨛᨊᨛ Repubuliki Pangkajene), is a [[w:Sovereign state|sovereign state]] situated in the northeastern [[Fosia]] in coast of western [[Shendan Ocean]] and north coast of [[Jade Sea]]. Located on the [[Balausian Peninsula]] bordering [[Balausia]] in west and [[Tondano]] in east, Pangkajene is characterized by its vast network of [[w:Harbor|deep-water harbors]] coastal area, and a rich, deeply [[w:Syncretism|syncretic]] [[w:Maritime history|maritime culture]] heavily influenced by both its indigenous roots. Its capital and largest city is Maros, build on the Marosan harbor area in western part of country and is a historically strategic port on Northeast Fosia
